{"3093580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Final Rider", "steam_appid": 3093580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093580/extras/eadf34c966a388c82255f1f387b398d6.poster.avif?t=1776015281\" width=372 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093580/extras/eadf34c966a388c82255f1f387b398d6.webm?t=1776015281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><strong>A comedy-fantasy isekai </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a broke, humiliated nobody who wins a Golden Ticket and the right to compete in a vicious game show for a grand prize of <strong>$300</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the time the <strong>51% disposal fee</strong>, the <strong>9% promotional deduction</strong>, and the legally mandatory fast-food coupon conversion are applied, the prize is barely worth the shame. Fail, hesitate, or stop moving, and the penalties begin to stack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The system does not want you to win.<br>It wants to make money off your desperation.<strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093580/extras/c2e4a2ba970998e97e5309b06310c448.poster.avif?t=1776015281\" width=480 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093580/extras/c2e4a2ba970998e97e5309b06310c448.webm?t=1776015281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093580/extras/c2e4a2ba970998e97e5309b06310c448.mp4?t=1776015281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beneath that surface is something else. This is a game about the “easy path” — the one that almost always ends in failure. About trying to find a quick way out, a magic button, the perfect solution… and hitting a wall again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You’ll face trials that tap into deep archetypes: the Seeker, the Shadow, the Anima, the Trickster.</i> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093580/extras/d7b130cf36a3ac8ab6a336382ad3c8c1.poster.avif?t=1776015281\" width=214 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093580/extras/d7b130cf36a3ac8ab6a336382ad3c8c1.webm?t=1776015281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093580/extras/d7b130cf36a3ac8ab6a336382ad3c8c1.mp4?t=1776015281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><u>This isn’t moralizing or a “psychology course” — it’s more like an interactive concept where the arcade becomes a mirror. And if you’re willing to look honestly, the game might unexpectedly help you understand something important about yourself.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What’s inside:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an ’80s arcade as a portal to a “purgatory” of game machines<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093580/extras/23414a5914b9b4977a86de10eaa4268d.poster.avif?t=1776015281\" width=226 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093580/extras/23414a5914b9b4977a86de10eaa4268d.webm?t=1776015281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093580/extras/23414a5914b9b4977a86de10eaa4268d.mp4?t=1776015281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiple modes and varied challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093580/extras/0fe30f75b85dceb50a8bd881b163b38e.poster.avif?t=1776015281\" width=375 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093580/extras/0fe30f75b85dceb50a8bd881b163b38e.webm?t=1776015281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093580/extras/286844e72296aa2a45cd658c659a08df.poster.avif?t=1776015281\" width=341 height=279 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093580/extras/286844e72296aa2a45cd658c659a08df.webm?t=1776015281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093580/extras/a7b33e8cdfbbf81415af244f2dd7f341.poster.avif?t=1776015281\" width=427 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093580/extras/a7b33e8cdfbbf81415af244f2dd7f341.webm?t=1776015281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >physics puzzles and strange situations<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093580/extras/4291112317b2e753d1b5d2465177dc02.poster.avif?t=1776